      "@id": "kt:ecs-native-blue-green-deployments",
      "@type": "kto:Feature",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Amazon ECS blue/green deployments",
      "skos:definition": "A deployment strategy built into the Amazon ECS deployment controller that starts a new (green) service revision beside the running (blue) one, shifts test and then production traffic to it in managed lifecycle stages, and keeps blue running for a bake period so rollback is near-instant; it also offers linear and canary traffic shifting.",
      "kto:domain": "containers",
