      "skos:definition": "The AWS service category for seeing, organizing, planning and reducing cloud spend: cost analysis (Cost Explorer, data exports, Cost Anomaly Detection), cost organization (cost allocation tags, cost categories), budgeting and planning (AWS Budgets, AWS Pricing Calculator), savings (Cost Optimization Hub, Savings Plans, reservations) and showback or chargeback (AWS Billing Conductor).",
