      "@id": "kt:canary-deployments",
      "@type": "kto:Pattern",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Canary deployments",
      "skos:definition": "A release pattern that exposes a new version to a small, randomly chosen share of production traffic first, watches its health, and only then shifts the rest of the traffic to it, rolling back if the canary misbehaves.",
