      "@id": "kt:immutable-infrastructure",
      "@type": "kto:Pattern",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Immutable infrastructure",
      "skos:definition": "An operating model in which running resources are never patched, reconfigured or upgraded in place; every change is shipped by building new resources from a versioned definition, shifting traffic to them, and discarding the old ones.",
