      "@id": "kt:aws-wavelength",
      "@type": "kto:InfrastructureConcept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "AWS Wavelength",
      "skos:definition": "AWS Wavelength places standard AWS compute and storage racks (Wavelength Zones) inside telecommunications providers' data centers at the edge of their 5G networks, extending a VPC from its parent Region so applications can serve mobile and carrier-connected devices with low latency.",
