      "@type": "kto:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Control plane and data plane",
      "skos:definition": "The split AWS draws inside every service between the control plane (the administrative APIs that create, describe, update, delete and list resources) and the data plane (the part that delivers the service's primary function), which determines how services fail and what a workload should rely on during recovery.",
      "kto:domain": "global-infrastructure",
