      "@type": "kto:Pattern",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Role-based access control (RBAC) on AWS",
      "skos:definition": "An authorization model in which permissions are bundled into roles that mirror job functions and people receive access only through the roles they are assigned; on AWS it is built from IAM roles and groups, job-function managed policies and IAM Identity Center permission sets.",
