      "@type": "kto:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "AWS compliance programs",
      "skos:definition": "The umbrella of third-party certifications and attestations, laws and regulations, and industry frameworks that AWS is audited against or aligns with, together with the Services in Scope lists and AWS Artifact reports customers use to inherit AWS's side of the controls.",
