      "@id": "kt:fips-140-3-on-aws",
      "@type": "kto:ComplianceProgram",
      "skos:prefLabel": "FIPS 140-3 on AWS",
      "skos:definition": "How AWS meets the U.S./Canadian FIPS 140-3 standard for cryptographic modules: services rely on CMVP-validated modules (AWS-LC, the AWS KMS and CloudHSM HSMs, Nitro engines), and customers who need FIPS-validated TLS in transit must opt in to FIPS endpoints, which exist only in U.S., GovCloud (US) and Canadian Regions.",
