      "skos:definition": "How customers subject to the U.S. International Traffic in Arms Regulations (ITAR) handle defense-related technical data on AWS: there is no ITAR certification, so qualified U.S. persons use the AWS GovCloud (US) Regions, whose AWS-side access is limited to U.S. persons, and keep export-compliance duties under the shared responsibility model.",
