      "@id": "kt:aws-firewall-manager",
      "@type": "kto:Service",
      "skos:prefLabel": "AWS Firewall Manager",
      "skos:definition": "AWS's organization-wide firewall policy service: an administrator account in AWS Organizations defines AWS WAF, Shield Advanced, security group, network ACL, Network Firewall, DNS Firewall and third-party firewall policies once, and Firewall Manager applies them to in-scope accounts and resources per Region, flagging or remediating drift. AWS has announced Network Security Manager as its eventual replacement.",
